	(text "AK4621EF codec, as the Timekeeper (IC401). Serial control (P/S high) bit-banged on CSN/CCLK/CDTI. PDN reset by RC.\nMono in: AINL+ from the input buffer U701A, AINL- from its inverted copy U701B; AINR+/- are parked at VCOM through 1k each [CONFIRM against the AK4621 datasheet]. Stereo out: AOUTL/AOUTR to the output stages (the Timekeeper wired them crossed; here L is L).\nU501 buffers VCOM: VCOM_A biases the input buffer and the inverter, VCOM_B references the output stages."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left bottom)
			)
		(uuid "331e1293-32ea-4c16-ac45-95f8c6b7c46e")
	)
